'''Zenitsu Agatsuma''' is a [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be obtained from the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Demon Slayer: Kimetsu no Yaiba Collaboration Event]]. He was added in [[Version 15.1 Update#Version 15.1.1 Update|Version 15.1.1]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 842
|rarity = UR
|name1 = Zenitsu Agatsuma
|name2 = Zenitsu Agatsuma CC
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Zenitsu Agatsuma CC''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
A powerful [[:Category:Anti-Zombie Cats|anti-Zombie]] nuker with a unique gimmick! Zenitsu Agatsuma stands at a short standing range and delivers [[Massive Damage]] with incredible forward piercing, an additional 250 range from where he stands at 220. He deals 309,400 damage to Zombies at Lv.30 (491,390 at Lv.50), which is immensely high.

His range makes his survivability questionable, but he generally outranges most common [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombies]], save for [[Lord Gravey]] and [[Cadaver Bear]], and can even strike both from a completely safe distance with stepping stones due to his [[Omni Strike]]. To exemplify his damage: at Lv.50, he does enough to instantly evaporate a Cadaver Bear at standard [[Uncanny Legends]] magnification (350%), and even post-[[Immeasurable Power]] scaling (420%) with a small Attack Up [[Cat Combo]].

Although Zenitsu Agatsuma is somewhat bulky for a nuker, don't expect him to stand his ground at all when push comes to shove. Attackers with a modicum of range are likely to deny him any leverage whatsoever if mistimed. Always make sure to work around his short standing range by deploying him in front of melee pushers or infrequent attackers, e.g. [[Zory]] and [[Deathshund]].

{{Job|Classification = Sniper & Nuker}}

